  b) Solely through the API.  A work is a Module only if it confines
     itself to the Module API.  A work that:

       i) patches, rewrites, or replaces any of the Program's own
          source files;

      ii) alters the run-time behaviour of the Program's own code by
          rebinding, wrapping, or replacing the Program's functions,
          classes, attributes, or objects (monkey-patching), other than
